# Isolation

This workspace (`titarvl-1to1`) is a **new** 1:1 rebuild of https://titarvl.framer.website/

Do **not**:
- Import, copy, or extend anything from `../NewBuild/` (`src/`, `globals.css`, `tokens.ts`, components, content)
- Reuse previous token names, spacing scales, type utilities, or layout classes from that rebuild
- Treat Uncage dump HTML as React source — parse it into `docs/research/` then implement fresh

Do:
- Put extraction artifacts only in `docs/research/` and `docs/design-references/`
- Build tokens/components only from extracted Framer CSS, `data-framer-name`, and live computed styles
- Keep content identical to the live Framer site until the user edits it later
